{"id": "unknown-2026-06-26-033", "date": "2026-06-26", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["slow", "weak"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "How storage is reshaping Italy’s energy system", "content": "<p>pv magazine has spoken with Federico Brucciani, secretary of Italian PV association Italia Solare, about the rapid expansion of residential solar-plus-storage in Italy, where 80% of new PV systems now include batteries. He also discussed the structural weaknesses of the C&#38;I segment and the slow regulatory rollout of flexibility markets despite the country’s rapidly growing distributed storage base.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/26/how-storage-is-reshaping-it", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/26/how-storage-is-reshaping-italys-energy-system/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-26-034", "date": "2026-06-26", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Agrivoltaics moving from niche concept to structured market segment", "content": "<p>pv magazine has spoken with Jochen Hauff, Senior Advisor for agrivoltaics to the Global Solar Council at the Smarter E trade show. He says agrivoltaics is rapidly evolving from a niche workaround into a standalone industry with its own technical, agricultural and social complexity, and that the solar sector must fundamentally rethink how it works with farmers and rural communities.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/26/agrivoltaics-moving-from-niche-concept-to-struct", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/26/agrivoltaics-moving-from-niche-concept-to-structured-market-segment/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-26-035", "date": "2026-06-26", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 26, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Longi showcases portable containerized photovoltaic station", "content": "<p>Longi's containerized Block PV station integrates modules, structure and GoodWe GT Series inverters into a rapidly deployable off-grid system. It reportedly achieves an LCOE of around €0.0413–€0.045/kWh in European markets such as Ukraine and Poland.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/26/longi-showcases-portable-containerized-photovoltaic-station/\">Longi showcases portable containerized photovoltaic station</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/26/longi-showcases-portable-containerized-photovoltaic-station/", "type": "rss"}]}
